# A price change with a smaller size still loses priority, and the old level survives.
> new 1 sell gtc 4 @100
< ack 1 sell qty=4 px=100 leaves=4
< level sell px=100 qty=4
> new 2 sell gtc 1 @100
< ack 2 sell qty=1 px=100 leaves=1
< level sell px=100 qty=5
> modify 1 qty=3 px=101
< modified 1 sell qty=3 px=101 leaves=3 lost
< level sell px=100 qty=1
< level sell px=101 qty=3
= depth sell px=100 qty=1 orders=1
= depth sell px=101 qty=3 orders=1
= hash 0x09add575d4a62a7a
